<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian AIICO profit up, issues scrip.</title>
<headline>Nigerian AIICO profit up, issues scrip.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nigeria's AIICO Insurance to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>	     (In million naira)</p>
<p>						1996	1995</p>
<p>Gross premium			    1,051 vs  708</p>
<p>Investment income			134.5 vs 97.1</p>
<p> Profit before taxation		 70.4 vs 37.5</p>
<p>Taxation				     2.2 vs 1.5</p>
<p>Profit after taxation		   68.2 vs 36</p>
<p>NOTE- The company did not declare any dividend but proposed a one-for-one scrip issue.</p>
<p>($1=83.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
